      "detail_main_html": "<main class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"detail-head\">\n<h1>\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"40\" src=\"/static/icons/ruin-ii.png\" style=\"vertical-align:-8px;margin-right:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\" width=\"40\"/>\n    \n    Ruin II\n  </h1>\n<p class=\"muted\">\n<a href=\"/classes/dread-knight\">Dread Knight</a>\n    \n    · Level 30\n    · Finishing Attack\n    \n  </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cols\">\n<div>\n<h2>Effect</h2>\n<div class=\"tooltip\">Deals 400% of weapon damage plus 239 to 255. Increases Dreadful Countenance. Only usable after Wrack.</div>\n<h2>As it was earlier</h2>\n<p class=\"muted small\">\n        What guides written while Vanguard was running recorded for this\n        ability. Kept beside the current figures rather than replacing them\n        — the game was rebalanced across its life, so both are right for\n        their own year.\n      </p>\n<dl class=\"facts\">\n<div><dt>Level in 2007</dt>\n<dd>30</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"muted small\">\n<a href=\"http://wiki.vanguardjapan.com/index.php?%E3%82%A2%E3%83%93%E3%83%AA%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%2FDread%20Knight\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">wiki.vanguardjapan.com</a>,\n          \n          2007 ·\n          <a href=\"/abilities/as-it-was\">every ability that changed</a>\n</p>\n<dl class=\"facts\">\n<div><dt>Level in 2007-2008</dt>\n<dd>32\n                <span class=\"muted\">— now 30</span></dd></div>\n<div><dt>Cast then</dt><dd>0</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Refresh then</dt><dd>30</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<div class=\"tooltip\">Lowers your offensive target's damage by 12% and accuracy by 14% for 18 sec. Cost: Submit Info Cast Time: 0 Refresh: 30 Range: 5 Wicked Strike V</div>\n<p class=\"muted small\">\n<a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/2009id_/http://www.tentonhammer.com/node/59407\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">Ten Ton Hammer class guides</a>,\n          \n          2007-2008 ·\n          <a href=\"/abilities/as-it-was\">every ability that changed</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"muted small figure-note\">\n        Damage, healing and hate in Vanguard scale with your stats, skills and\n        level — the figures above are the ability's own, not what a\n        particular character will see.\n      </p>\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Dreadful Countenance is a debuff carried by the target, not a buff on the Dread Knight. Many abilities and procs raise it, and they stack — which is why so many tooltips mention increasing it without saying what it is.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Previously recorded by The Telon Project as: “Deals 400% weapon damage plus 239 to 255. Increases Dreadful Countenance. Only usable after Wrack” (http://thetelonproject.wikidot.com/abilities:ruin-ii)</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">An earlier reading from VGO Emulator, on a character with different stats, gave: “Deals 400% of weapon damage plus 239 to 255. Increases Dreadful Countenance. Only usable after Wrack”</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Read from the in-game tooltip in VGO Emulator. Bracketed damage figures shown in game are the skill- and level-adjusted values for that character and are not recorded here.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>Details</h2>\n<dl class=\"kv\">\n<div><dt>Level</dt><dd>30</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Endurance cost</dt><dd>10</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Cast time</dt><dd>Instant</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Range</dt><dd>5m</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Target</dt><dd>Offensive Target</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Requires</dt><dd>Wrack</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Finishing Attack</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Learned from</dt><dd>Class Trainers</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul class=\"plain\">\n<li><strong>Verified from the in-game tooltip</strong>\n<span class=\"muted\">— these figures override the wikis</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://thetelonproject.wikidot.com/abilities:ruin-ii\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">The Telon Project</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:26px\"><a href=\"/abilities\">← All abilities</a></p>\n</main>",
